Monster Party Recompiled @VERSION@

GET STARTED

Windows: extract the complete ZIP, then open MonsterPartyRecomp.exe.
Linux: make the AppImage executable, then open it.
Select your original Monster Party (USA) ROM and choose PLAY.
No game ROM is included.

WIDESCREEN

Open Mods > Display and enable Adaptive Widescreen. Aspect is the only setting:
Fit follows your window; 16:9, 21:9 and 32:9 are also available. Enemies appear
across the wider view, and the stage camera stops at level edges. The HUD and
boss rooms stay centered.

CONTROLS AND PROGRESS

Arrow keys: move. Z: A. X: B. Enter: Start. Backslash: Select.
Escape: menu. Change keyboard and controller bindings in the launcher.
F8/F9: quick save/load. Quick saves are specific to a build; keep the game's
passwords for progress you want to carry into an update.

UPDATES AND HELP

https://github.com/mstan/MonsterPartyNESRecomp
When reporting a problem, include your version, operating system, aspect
setting and the steps that caused it. A screenshot is helpful.

Project and third-party licenses are in licenses/.
